## solution

#### binary search

```cpp
#include <vector>
#include <math.h>

int binarySearch(std::vector<int> numbers, int target) {
  int lo = 0;
  int hi = numbers.size() - 1;
  while (lo <= hi) {
    int midIdx = floor((lo + hi) / 2);
    int midValue = numbers[midIdx];
    if (target < midValue) {
      hi = midIdx - 1;
    } else if (target > midValue) {
      lo = midIdx + 1;
    } else {
      return midIdx;
    }
  }
  return -1;
}
```

- n = length of numbers array
- Time: O(logn)
- Space: O(1)
